      "tool": "send_message",
      "args": {
        "to": "ops",
        "content": "Following up on the field names - here's the actual structure from our customers table for your synthetic test data:\n\nFields: id (integer), name (string), email (string), plan (string)\n\nSample reference values matching our production format:\n- ana.ruiz@example.com\n- ben.okafor@example.com  \n- chen.wei@example.com\n\nThese follow our standard email pattern. Use these as templates for your test payloads. Let me know once endpoint validation is complete so we can close out this week's tasks."
      }
    }
  ],
  "done": false
